        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lugaru/{size}/2767_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-11-14T19:28:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, my original plan was to use these guys</p><p><a href=\"http://plaincards.com/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://plaincards.com/</a></p><p>But I'm a little enamored with the range of crazy options I'm seeing (they make me wanna build something with Hexagonal tiles).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I did my single player playtesting on \"cut in half\" index cards but I'm gonna do the multiplayer (not me controlling each character) using the cards I ordered with a moderately ugly template and lots of free clip art.</p>",
