        "raw": "<p>Yeah, my original plan was to use these guys</p><p><a href=\"http://plaincards.com/\">http://plaincards.com/</a></p><p>But I&#39;m a little enamored with the range of crazy options I&#39;m seeing (they make me wanna build something with Hexagonal tiles).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I did my single player playtesting on &quot;cut in half&quot; index cards but I&#39;m gonna do the multiplayer (not me controlling each character) using the cards I ordered with a moderately ugly template and lots of free clip art.</p>",
